{'symbol': 'ON', 'date': '2023-03-06 17:40:00', 'title': "ONSEMI TO INTEGRATE ITS SILICON CARBIDE TECHNOLOGY IN BMW GROUP'S NEXT-GENERATION ELECTRIC VEHICLES", 'text': "SCOTTSDALE, ARIZ.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ONSEMI (NASDAQ: ON), A LEADER IN INTELLIGENT POWER AND SENSING TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED A LONG-TERM SUPPLY AGREEMENT (LTSA) WITH BMW AG (BMW) FOR ONSEMI'S ELITESIC TECHNOLOGY IN THE GERMAN PREMIUM CAR MANUFACTURER'S ELECTRIC DRIVETRAINS FOR 400 V DC BUS. ONSEMI'S LATEST ELITESIC 750 V M3 DIE IS USED IN A FULL BRIDGE POWER MODULE DELIVERING SEVERAL HUNDRED KWS OF POWER."}